Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Episode\NThe Daughter of Mephisto
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel it, this is the moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.78,0:02:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally I have found\Nthat girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I soldiers have already\Ncollected the taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't steal any more money!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.22,0:02:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop him!\N- But who is that knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke all the sacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That damned bastard won't\Nstop us from collecting the taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that you have\Nto pay the new taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.54,0:02:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a single penny left!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.34,0:02:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay what you have to pay\Nor you will pay with your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So you didn't have any money, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.14,0:02:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's the little bit\NI need to live on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! And now you want to live too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you leave\Nthis poor man alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have nothing to do with it! I was ordered\Nto collect the new taxes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.34,0:03:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but this man doesn't want to pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So you are Duralumin's\Nmen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.10,0:03:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's none of your business!\NAnd who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.50,0:03:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid, are you trying to mock us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this little fool says he is\NPrince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.70,0:03:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- A Prince without an escort!\N- He's just a brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's get rid of him quickly.\N- If you don't disappear, I'll skewer you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! The brat is over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not me you're supposed to skewer!\NIt's that guy over there, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing to laugh about!\NIt's over for you, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come on, bring it on!\NI'm not afraid of you at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.02,0:03:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your choice:\Neither the taxes or jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn, I'm pinned down!\N- Nice shot! Now let's finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Leave him to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.54,0:04:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it that\Nthe brat is over there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell my father everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come down, Prince! It's time\Nfor you to return to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But where has he gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.50,0:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Prince! Forgive\Nthe rudeness of my men!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So it really is the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Make them return the money\Nthey took from the villagers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's split it, Prince, so we can\Nboth have fun with that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want that money!\NYou must return it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, Prince, I will\Ndo as you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.10,0:05:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That brat is insolent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.06,0:05:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You, blockheads,\Ncontinue the tax collection!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Spread the word that the money\Nis needed by the Prince for a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.82,0:05:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince must\Nbuild himself a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are you doing, slacker?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go collect the taxes! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, I have finally found\Nthe girl I was looking for!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl?! Do you\Nmean that Prince, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! She is a female,\Nbut with a boy's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mistake that Heaven\Nmakes every 2,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, poor thing! How\Nsorry I feel for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I am convinced that you would\Nbecome an excellent witch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,..if you could exchange\Nyour heart for hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, infernal winds! Honor\Nmy daughter Hecate, lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder! Wind! Lightning bolts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stir, scourges of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.74,0:06:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, hurricanes, celebrate\Nthe beauty of my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Hecate, you\Ntoo will try to...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, where did you\Ngo? Hecate! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,My father would like me to be different\Nfrom how I am, you know, little bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Aren't you ashamed\Nof keeping flowers in your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...and little birds in your hand? Change\Nthe flowers into something ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.74,0:06:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:06:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you transform it\Non my head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Try with a storm, come on!\N- Come, lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow, wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.90,0:07:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fall, rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well?!\N- I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, my little witch!\NWe'll find a remedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will have you take\Na course in witchcraft,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.46,0:07:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so you will become an excellent witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who threw water on me?\NAh, it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could fly too\Nin the sky, just like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say? Would you take me\Nfor a little ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready! You can go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.78,0:08:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink! Where are you going?\N- I'm having a little fun flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm coming too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No! The strings can't take it!\NWe would be too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnificent!\NFly high!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.10,0:08:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even higher! Even\Nfurther up, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Higher and higher, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Sapphire!\NYou are too heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must try not to\Ntouch the treetops!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The swans can't make it! Now\Nyou are too close to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize,\NMr. Bull! I apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! I'm going to\Ncrash into a house!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, I really\Nwasn't able to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.98,0:08:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We worked day and\Nnight to build this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.34,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought it was a pigsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.38,0:08:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Boy, how dare you?!\N- How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not by our choice\Nthat we live in this hut!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Our house was destroyed\Nby the Grand Duke's henchmen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.70,0:09:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,so we were forced\Nto live miserably!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- They did this to you?! - Yes! They\Ntook everything we had!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They told us\Nthat the usual taxes are not enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so we have to pay more,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.78,0:09:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,because the Prince\Nmust build himself a castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Prince Sapphire is to blame!\N- He is a stupid Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.94,0:09:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They lied to you! I don't have to\Nbuild myself any castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- But then you are...!\N- Our Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- is it really you?!\N- I must speak to the Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Sapphire go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I have the impression that Mephisto\Nis lurking right around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We must find him immediately, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Sapphire?\NAnswer if you hear me! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a magnificent castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It is truly huge! Make yourself more comfortable,\Ndon't get too worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.30,0:10:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it all depends on you, Opal!\NI'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.14,0:10:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire is entering\Nthe castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see\NGrand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Grand Duke has gone hunting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Then I will wait for him inside!\N- You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.22,0:10:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?! - I was joking!\NPlease, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.22,0:10:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the apartments\Nof the Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful house!\NSome have too much and some have nothing, eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire is here, Grand Duke
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He is bringing along\Nsome strange people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a stroke of luck\Nthat he came to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think I understand.\N- You could kill him now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.62,0:10:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,without anyone knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow\NSapphire to be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That bust is speaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is mine!\NNo one must touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourself! Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare us,\Nwhoever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mephisto!\NAnd you will do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mephisto, why does Sapphire\Ninterest you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I must transplant the heart\Nof Sapphire into my daughter's chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.06,0:11:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that way I will succeed in\Nmaking her a great witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing something like\Nthat is truly impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Mephisto! For me,\Neverything is possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Turn into flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is a cheap trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Insolent! "Cheap", you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you like an electric cape?\N- Ouch, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're not convinced...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.14,0:11:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you convinced,\Nnow, of my power?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mephisto! But what\Nwill happen to Sapphire...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.22,0:12:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...when will you succeed in taking\Nhis boy's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.54,0:12:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She will only become\Nan ordinary girl
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is what we want too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.66,0:12:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Grand Duke,\NMephisto can be of use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If he makes the Prince\Na girl, the throne will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord of darkness, I pay\Nhomage to you! I have decided to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine!\NThen bring Sapphire here to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.70,0:12:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running to call him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, I know you are at the castle!\NShow yourself! I must speak with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, please come in! We have\Nprepared a worthy welcome for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I am only here to ask\Nthe Grand Duke...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...why he had the house\Nof these men destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I just wanted\Nto compensate them for the damage suffered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! These provisions are for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- And now scram!\N- Thank you, sir! We are grateful to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, please.\NThe Grand Duke is waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.10,0:12:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Grand Duke? I don't see him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire! It's me: Tink!\N- Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.06,0:12:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot enter the castle of\Nthe Grand Duke without permission!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be the end of the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.22,0:12:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Grand Duke, show\Nyourself! I would like to speak to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will annihilate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand: you are Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.34,0:13:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, little Prince! I am\Ntruly glad to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.86,0:13:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,For a long time I have been\Nwaiting for this day to arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.02,0:13:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.06,0:13:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart, so fearless that\Nit does not fear the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.22,0:13:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want it,\Nyou'll have to conquer it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just you and me, Mephisto!\N- Go, Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damnation!\N- Go, Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- May he fall into my power!\N- I feel paralyzed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can no longer feel my muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you are in my hands and nothing\Nmore will stop me from taking your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Diabolical hands,\Nemanate your infernal fluid...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.94,0:13:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,..that envelops every\Nmortal in a shroud of sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We did well\Nto ally with the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And who could that be? You\Ngo and see who it is, Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.98,0:14:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire! Wake\Nup! Don't go near him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?! I..\NAh, I'm paralyzed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mephisto!\N- Break the spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I recognize you: you are\Nan angel! I will have my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Fall down the stairs!\NWait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it,\Nwe almost made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto, you have really\Ndisappointed me! Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- You were saying?\N- You let yourself be fooled like a novice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't do anything!\NThat child is an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,An angel\Nis a difficult opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.74,0:14:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nylon!\N- Yes, Grand Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get that nose out of my face!\N- Is this okay, Grand Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- We must kill that boy.\N- Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wake up! He's still\Nunconscious! I must look for some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.74,0:15:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll splash it on his face, like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, my nose! My nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- I captured him, Grand Duke!\N- The boy has left you in quite a bad way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come near me!\NTake him away! He'll disintegrate us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes! yes! yes!\N- You can continue your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto! Infernal forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.94,0:15:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Emanate from my hands\Nand envelop the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,May he be lifted into the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.78,0:15:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,May he be brought to my lair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you for your help!\N- You're welcome, Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the throne will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You will stay up there until\Nthe eagles devour you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Long live the Baron!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't manage to free myself!\NThe knots are too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very worried about Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not your breakfast! If you want\Nto scare me, you've succeeded!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.78,0:16:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go away, otherwise..\Nmore will come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark forces of evil,\Nof the underworld and of darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,rise from the eternal fire\Nand from the cold of the graves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Mephisto, your master,\Ncall you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Enter! Come into the crucible\Nof my black magic alchemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:17:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Lie down on the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You are about to become\Na great witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you the heart and the courage\Nof this girl, soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic potion\Nwill release the energy of evil within you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.10,0:17:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise, tree of wickedness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.06,0:17:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me execute my work!\NI command you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment has come! My\Nmasterpiece will be completed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Will you stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.90,0:17:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't make it! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.18,0:17:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! There's a shoe\Nfallen from the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? Let's go see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.66,0:17:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I see! Brothers, over\Nthere is a child hanging from a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do we do?\N- We must help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:18:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Before they devour him!\N- Quick, brothers, let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.86,0:18:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start cutting from\Nwhere I'm cutting, eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! This is the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They are helping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out from under the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, a ravine!\NWe won't make it across!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If we cut down that tree,\Nit can serve us as a bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.38,0:18:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can cross\Nthe ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- And aren't you coming? - The ravine\Nmarks the border of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- We are forbidden to go beyond.\N- Then goodbye, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.06,0:19:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,infernal and occult forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.34,0:19:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Guide me, demon brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold my hand tight!\NNow I will take her heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.22,0:19:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Tree of evil, stop\Nthat angel from approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't make it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.26,0:19:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You must suffocate him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.02,0:20:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take this!\N- What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.90,0:20:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!\NI'll get you, damned feather!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! My eye!\NLa formula, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto! Disappear, feather!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.50,0:20:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The tree of evil will die!\NDon't dare to come near!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,See what you've done,\NHecate? Stop that angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking the girl away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.26,0:20:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Infernal frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Infernal tarantula!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It wants to catch me with that thread!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.10,0:21:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless for you to hide,\NMephisto! I know you're not far!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.46,0:21:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They are cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.42,0:21:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I destroyed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.42,0:21:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tink!\N- Yes, Sapphire, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Tink, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in Mephisto's lair! Look!\NHail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto! This time\Nyou won't defeat me! Wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is another monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.90,0:21:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise, immense monster!\NAnd devour Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.06,0:22:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop!\N- It's terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's moving the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this and drink it!\NI hope you like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.82,0:22:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you to devour them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.86,0:22:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want a fight to the\Ndeath! Mountain, sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.50,0:22:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.42,0:22:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening? It's all vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.34,0:23:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand\Nwhat happened either!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone must have helped you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.30,0:23:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it was Hecate!\NHecate, come here immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.90,0:23:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it you who helped\Nthe Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, I'm sorry to confess it,\Nbut it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.46,0:23:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But my daughter, it is for you\Nthat I did all this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.14,0:23:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted it for your own good, to\Nmake you become an excellent witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, you helped Sapphire!\NWhy did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.62,0:23:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I don't want to become\Na witch when I grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.58,0:23:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Little degenerate, unnatural and\Nunworthy daughter of your father!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.94,0:23:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't give up! One day, I\Nwill succeed in taking your heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.74,0:23:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...to give it to my daughter\NHecate! Remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.66,0:23:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That little girl will\Nnever become a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.94,0:23:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- She's too good!\N- Yes, she really is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:18.76,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.76,0:24:22.12,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.76,0:24:22.12,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:25.89,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.89,0:24:29.05,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.89,0:24:29.05,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.06,0:24:32.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k41}{\k46}Sen{\k38}'nen {\k52}man{\k41}'nen {\k34}hya{\k25}ku{\k33}man{\k38}-nen{\k33}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.06,0:24:32.87,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,
